# Deploy Log

> **Superseded by the `deploys/` ledger (v0.45.0).** `build/deploy` still
> appends one line here when this file exists, so existing history does not
> stop mid-stream — but the authoritative record is now
> `deploys/records/<id>.md`, with `deploys/DEPLOYS.md` as its generated
> view and `/deploys` as the reader. That record carries the environment
> class, the intent (deploy vs release), how consent was given, the failing
> stage, and the branch and sha. Delete this file to stop the append.

Append-only record of every deploy run. Generated automatically by
`build/deploy`. Use this for audit (who deployed what to where, when)
and for forensics when something goes sideways.

| Timestamp | Env | User | Tag | Result | Duration | Notes |
